{"3815560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ashfield Hollow", "steam_appid": 3815560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4983190], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ten years after the outbreak, you wake up in Camp Ashfield with no memory of who you were and a new life to build in what remains of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ashfield Hollow is a 2D post-apocalyptic life sim blending real-time survival combat with farming, base building, and the slow work of rebuilding a life in a world that nearly ended. And still can.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Survive the Infected</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fight relentless infected in real-time combat, from isolated encounters to overwhelming hordes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815560/extras/65e03051ef6145bc65721d41309dcaaa.poster.avif?t=1788156755\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815560/extras/65e03051ef6145bc65721d41309dcaaa.webm?t=1788156755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815560/extras/65e03051ef6145bc65721d41309dcaaa.mp4?t=1788156755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Face Hostile Survivors</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fight desperate survivors competing for the same supplies and take on dangerous extraction runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815560/extras/0fa0a3fb7b26b3f6f71f0e515f5ebb37.poster.avif?t=1788156755\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815560/extras/0fa0a3fb7b26b3f6f71f0e515f5ebb37.webm?t=1788156755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815560/extras/0fa0a3fb7b26b3f6f71f0e515f5ebb37.mp4?t=1788156755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Build a Home Worth Defending</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Build and expand your base with barns, greenhouses, crafting stations, generators, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815560/extras/de91dba65f5ef4c405988a726ced73f7.poster.avif?t=1788156755\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815560/extras/de91dba65f5ef4c405988a726ced73f7.webm?t=1788156755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815560/extras/de91dba65f5ef4c405988a726ced73f7.mp4?t=1788156755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Farm, Fish, and Raise Animals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Grow crops, fish, forage, raise animals, and produce the food you need to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815560/extras/3203444caeb927491a594fd79a6af840.poster.avif?t=1788156755\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815560/extras/3203444caeb927491a594fd79a6af840.webm?t=1788156755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815560/extras/3203444caeb927491a594fd79a6af840.mp4?t=1788156755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Become Part of Camp Ashfield</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Build relationships with the survivors around you, complete personal missions, and uncover their stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815560/extras/a7c963ccf879b8c2f0aaa663f97a3c5f.poster.avif?t=1788156755\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815560/extras/a7c963ccf879b8c2f0aaa663f97a3c5f.webm?t=1788156755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815560/extras/a7c963ccf879b8c2f0aaa663f97a3c5f.mp4?t=1788156755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Explore a Broken World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Travel through forests, abandoned towns, ruined buildings, and dangerous sewers in search of what remains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815560/extras/a1f1325d63bc9fd3e21d0e8464918b21.poster.avif?t=1788156755\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815560/extras/a1f1325d63bc9fd3e21d0e8464918b21.webm?t=1788156755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=